{"type":"message","id":"f6b991d3","parentId":"c4e5c1d8","timestamp":"2026-05-16T00:50:26.007Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 12:50 AM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 00:50 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778892625923}}
{"type":"message","id":"4d765dfa","parentId":"f6b991d3","timestamp":"2026-05-16T00:50:32.157Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform by making HTTP requests to monitor discussion threads and respond if needed. Let me make the requests to check both threads.\n\nI need to:\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5\n3. Check if there are new messages (not from me)\n4. Respond if needed via POST /send\n\nLet me make these requests using curl.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-f72211ec-4eba-45c9-8586-1df2d90b2332","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-f2b6aa8c-cd61-4de0-af8e-6b90f7b768cf","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":226,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11349,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778892626007,"responseId":"chatcmpl-23ddabea-ec90-4056-8320-d752bb45cea1"}}
